** Soundboard Lab -- *TIE mechanics proof, case 1: CONTINUOUS reference.
**
** Two stacked C3D8 hexes (10x10x10mm each, z=[0,10] and z=[10,20]),
** sharing the 4 interface nodes directly (12 unique nodes total,
** standard Abaqus/CalculiX C3D8 node order -- see stage1_single_hex.inp)
** -- the "ground truth" a correctly-working *TIE case (see
** tie_proof_tied.inp) should closely reproduce. Same material/units/
** free-free setup as the project's own validated
** tests/data/stage1_single_hex.inp, extended to two elements.
